    "created_at": "2017-08-17T19:25:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-17T19:25:09Z",
    "body": "I just found  #1810 and #1869.  Now I'm confused -- how did these get back in?  I thought I checked blame and didn't find where they were added.  And why remove frameset?  My test indicates that all browsers do support it on window (but not document).  I just tested on Chrome, WebKit, Firefox, and Edge, and all of them pass my frameset tests.  What's the difference between my tests and w3c/web-platform-tests#3875?  Perhaps because that's in an iframe?  I'll add an iframe test to this PR too to see what happens.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
